7
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,634
<font color="white"><i>I got my hands on the secret footage</i></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:32,717 --> 00:01:34,761
<font color="white"><i>that the local middlemen had taken</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>just in case.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

