<font color="white"><i>That's a common tactic used</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to </i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>cause </i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>confusion.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:51,194 --> 00:01:52,153
<font color="white"><i>Are you all right?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:01:54,197 --> 00:01:56,074
<font color="white">So what were their orders?</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:01:57,492 --> 00:01:58,409
<font color="white">Were they told</font><font color="white"></font>

18
