<font color="white"><i>No.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,961
<font color="white"><i>The order was to hold him</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and release him later.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:09,170 --> 00:02:10,296
<font color="white"><i>But things went sideways.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:11,506 --> 00:02:12,507
<font color="white"><i>The person in the photo…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:14,259 --> 00:02:15,426
<font color="white"><i>is your mother, right?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:31,943 --> 00:02:36,364
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:02:37,073 --> 00:02:38,950
{\an8}<font color="white">EPISODE 9</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:03,892 --> 00:03:07,562
{\an8}<font color="white">Wasn't Pi-o absolutely amazing today?</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:07,645 --> 00:03:09,063
{\an8}<font color="white">Totally.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:09,147 --> 00:03:11,691
{\an8}<font color="white">He absolutely killed it.</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:11,774 --> 00:03:13,818
{\an8}<font color="white">I knew he could do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:13,902 --> 00:03:15,653
{\an8}<font color="white">That slump he was in?</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:15,737 --> 00:03:17,530
<font color="white">I knew he'd get over it before long.</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:18,281 --> 00:03:19,908
<font color="white">Because Pi-o is</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:20,533 --> 00:03:23,912
<font color="white">a special gift sent to me from God.</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:23,995 --> 00:03:25,455
<font color="white">Agreed.</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:25,538 --> 00:03:27,749
<font color="white">To your son, Pi-o Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:28,249 --> 00:03:32,170
<font color="white">He's totally a gift from the heavens.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:36,507 --> 00:03:40,678
<font color="white">From the moment I discovered his talent,</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:41,221 --> 00:03:45,391
<font color="white">I never once doubted</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he'd become a great pianist.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

39
00:03:45,475 --> 00:03:47,185
<font color="white">I clearly saw it coming.</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:03:47,977 --> 00:03:49,812
<font color="white">So I did everything I could.</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:03:50,563 --> 00:03:52,899
<font color="white">I did whatever it took for Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:03:52,982 --> 00:03:56,694
<font color="white">That's what made Pi-o who he is today.</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:58,071
<font color="white">Don't you agree?</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:03:58,154 --> 00:03:59,239
<font color="white">I do.</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:03:59,739 --> 00:04:02,659
<font color="white">You're really amazing.</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:03,993 --> 00:04:05,495
<font color="white">But please don't forget</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:05,578 --> 00:04:09,624
<font color="white">that we set the stage for them</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the right moment.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

48
00:04:09,707 --> 00:04:12,252
<font color="white">Pairing two people</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with that kind of chemistry</font><font color="white"></font></font>

49
00:04:12,335 --> 00:04:14,879
<font color="white">is what created that magic, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:17,924
<font color="white">You're right.</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:18,007 --> 00:04:21,636
<font color="white">They certainly have a special chemistry.</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:39,904 --> 00:04:41,197
<font color="white">Gosh, you scared me.</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:44,659
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:45,201 --> 00:04:46,828
<font color="white">Is the after-party already over?</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:49,205 --> 00:04:50,206
<font color="white">Why are you here?</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:53,835
<font color="white">Did you stay up to see me?</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:04:56,629 --> 00:04:58,589
<font color="white">I was so happy today.</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:04:59,882 --> 00:05:03,594
<font color="white">I knew you would do a phenomenal job.</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:04,178 --> 00:05:07,015
<font color="white">Tell everyone who said you hit a slump</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to show their faces.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

60
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,318
<font color="white">What's wrong?</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:20,069 --> 00:05:21,696
<font color="white">Why did you do it, Mom?</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,489
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:26,200
<font color="white">Why did you hire someone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to abduct Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

64
00:05:28,578 --> 00:05:30,371
<font color="white">I don't know what you're talking about.</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:35,251 --> 00:05:37,295
<font color="white">How could someone do that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to another person?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

66
00:05:37,879 --> 00:05:40,173
<font color="white">How could you commit a crime like that?</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:40,256 --> 00:05:41,924
<font color="white">I knew you doubted me,</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:42,008 --> 00:05:44,302
<font color="white">but what on earth were you thinking?</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:46,596 --> 00:05:48,973
<font color="white">I have no idea what you're saying.</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:05:49,057 --> 00:05:50,725
<font color="white">Hire? Abduct?</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:05:51,893 --> 00:05:54,270
<font color="white">How could you accuse me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of something so horrifying?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

72
00:06:01,736 --> 00:06:02,612
<font color="white">Where…</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:04,614 --> 00:06:05,865
<font color="white">Where did you get this photo?</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:05,948 --> 00:06:07,033
<font color="white">That's not the point.</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:07,116 --> 00:06:08,409
<font color="white">I asked you a question!</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:08,493 --> 00:06:11,621
<font color="white">I got it from the middlemen</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you hired for the abduction.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

77
00:06:11,704 --> 00:06:12,580
<font color="white">So?</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:13,873 --> 00:06:15,208
<font color="white">Will you still deny it?</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:29,097 --> 00:06:29,931
<font color="white">You're right.</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:31,224 --> 00:06:32,433
<font color="white">I ordered the abduction.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:37,897
<font color="white">It was the finals,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and you hurt your finger.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

82
00:06:39,273 --> 00:06:40,358
<font color="white">I couldn't think straight.</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:06:41,484 --> 00:06:44,112
<font color="white">I devoted my entire life</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to seeing you win,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

84
00:06:44,195 --> 00:06:46,280
<font color="white">but you said you'd quit if you didn't.</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:06:46,364 --> 00:06:47,865
<font color="white">It drove me insane.</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:06:48,366 --> 00:06:49,325
<font color="white">But Pi-o,</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:06:50,243 --> 00:06:51,661
<font color="white">I need you to know this.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:06:52,912 --> 00:06:55,498
<font color="white">I had no intention of killing him.</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:06:55,581 --> 00:06:58,292
<font color="white">I told them to keep him for a bit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and let him go.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

90
00:06:58,876 --> 00:07:00,920
<font color="white">I thought about everything</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from turning myself in</font><font color="white"></font></font>

91
00:07:01,003 --> 00:07:02,171
<font color="white">to coming clean to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:02,255 --> 00:07:03,089
<font color="white">But then…</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:05,842 --> 00:07:08,136
<font color="white">Then you won first place</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the competition.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

94
00:07:11,222 --> 00:07:13,558
<font color="white">I couldn't lay that disgrace on you.</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:14,058 --> 00:07:16,060
<font color="white">Not after everything</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you went through to earn it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

96
00:07:17,937 --> 00:07:18,938
<font color="white">You understand</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:19,814 --> 00:07:21,399
<font color="white">why I had to do it, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:23,734 --> 00:07:25,403
<font color="white">I just wanted the best for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:26,195 --> 00:07:27,113
<font color="white">It was for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:27,196 --> 00:07:29,407
<font color="white">Stop talking nonsense!</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:29,490 --> 00:07:33,244
<font color="white">Did you think about</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">how disgraceful it'd be to win like that?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

102
00:07:33,327 --> 00:07:34,787
<font color="white">Because of that accident,</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:07:34,871 --> 00:07:37,290
<font color="white">Jeong-yo can't play the piano anymore</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and lost his memories!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

104
00:07:37,373 --> 00:07:39,625
<font color="white">It was hard for me too!</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:42,962
<font color="white">I thought I had lost my mind</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and regretted it so much.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

106
00:07:43,629 --> 00:07:46,174
<font color="white">I haven't slept peacefully</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since that happened.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

107
00:07:46,257 --> 00:07:47,133
<font color="white">But…</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:07:49,051 --> 00:07:50,595
<font color="white">what can we do about it now?</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:07:51,345 --> 00:07:52,805
<font color="white">If the truth comes out,</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:07:53,431 --> 00:07:56,058
<font color="white">both of our lives will be over.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:07:56,642 --> 00:07:58,144
<font color="white">How could I possibly live like that?</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:07:58,227 --> 00:08:01,022
<font color="white">People will point fingers at me,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saying I ruined your life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

113
00:08:02,064 --> 00:08:04,192
<font color="white">I wouldn't last a single day of that.</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:06,736
<font color="white">If you commit a crime,</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:08:06,819 --> 00:08:08,196
<font color="white">you should be punished.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,697
<font color="white">That goes for both of us.</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:11,866
<font color="white">Let's go.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:08:11,949 --> 00:08:13,784
<font color="white">We'll confess to Jeong-yo</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and ask for his forgiveness.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

119
00:08:13,868 --> 00:08:15,495
<font color="white">No, I won't go!</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:08:16,954 --> 00:08:18,623
<font color="white">Jeong-yo didn't die after all,</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:08:19,665 --> 00:08:20,666
<font color="white">and now…</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:08:21,584 --> 00:08:23,085
<font color="white">now we're back to where we started.</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:29,842 --> 00:08:30,718
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:08:31,344 --> 00:08:33,054
<font color="white">As long as we bury this secret,</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:33,721 --> 00:08:36,057
<font color="white">we can go on living like nothing happened.</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,141
<font color="white"><i>So please…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:08:39,393 --> 00:08:40,978
<font color="white"><i>Do you hear yourself?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:08:41,062 --> 00:08:42,730
<font color="white"><i>That won't make the crime just disappear.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:08:43,648 --> 00:08:44,732
<font color="white">Mom.</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:08:45,316 --> 00:08:48,027
<font color="white">Do you really want to hit rock bottom?</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:08:49,237 --> 00:08:50,404
<font color="white">Come on.</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:08:50,488 --> 00:08:52,490
<font color="white">Let's go and tell him everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:08:52,573 --> 00:08:54,534
<font color="white">No!</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:08:57,578 --> 00:08:58,871
<font color="white">I'd rather die</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:09:00,206 --> 00:09:01,832
<font color="white">than let anyone know about this.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:09:02,833 --> 00:09:03,709
<font color="white">Are you…</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:09:04,502 --> 00:09:06,420
<font color="white">willing to let me die like this?</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:52,693 --> 00:10:54,695
<font color="white">What brings you here at this hour?</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:11:03,037 --> 00:11:05,164
<font color="white">What is this about? Why are you stalling?</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:11:05,247 --> 00:11:06,457
<font color="white">Go on, tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:11:12,463 --> 00:11:13,589
<font color="white">You don't look well.</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:11:14,715 --> 00:11:16,133
<font color="white">Are you hiding something from me?</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:24,350 --> 00:11:25,184
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:26,644 --> 00:11:28,854
<font color="white">So I'm here to ask for your forgiveness.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:11:32,149 --> 00:11:34,693
<font color="white">Nine years ago</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the Harmonie International Competition…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

146
00:11:37,655 --> 00:11:39,365
<font color="white"><i>I'd rather die</i></font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:39,990 --> 00:11:41,659
<font color="white">than let anyone know about this.</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:41,742 --> 00:11:42,660
<font color="white">Are you…</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:46,747
<font color="white">willing to let me die like this?</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:55,965 --> 00:11:57,967
<font color="white">I was able to win the competition</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:59,468 --> 00:12:01,053
<font color="white">because of your sheet music.</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:12:02,304 --> 00:12:04,807
<font color="white">I'd lost the sheet music for the set piece</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the chapel,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

153
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:06,100
<font color="white">so I was going to withdraw.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:12:07,226 --> 00:12:09,228
<font color="white">But you lent me yours.</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:12:10,187 --> 00:12:12,022
<font color="white">I only managed to play so well</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:12:12,648 --> 00:12:14,608
<font color="white">thanks to the notes you left.</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:12:16,026 --> 00:12:17,361
<font color="white">So where I stand right now…</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:12:20,531 --> 00:12:21,490
<font color="white">belongs to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:12:23,075 --> 00:12:25,327
<font color="white">I didn't have the courage</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to tell you the truth before.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

160
00:12:30,499 --> 00:12:31,333
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:12:49,643 --> 00:12:50,478
<font color="white">That's it?</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:12:52,438 --> 00:12:53,898
<font color="white">That's what you wanted to tell me?</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:56,984
<font color="white">I don't quite understand.</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:12:57,067 --> 00:12:58,486
<font color="white">All this over sheet music?</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:12:59,487 --> 00:13:00,946
<font color="white">Interpreting it is one thing.</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:13:01,947 --> 00:13:03,741
<font color="white">But how you play it is another matter.</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:13:05,701 --> 00:13:06,660
<font color="white">I watched</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:13:07,953 --> 00:13:09,580
<font color="white">a video of your competition performance.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:13:10,664 --> 00:13:13,292
<font color="white">You had a distinct style</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that went beyond interpretation.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

170
00:13:14,251 --> 00:13:16,462
<font color="white">Anyway, I don't care about</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">things like that.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

171
00:13:18,130 --> 00:13:19,089
<font color="white">Come on.</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:13:20,925 --> 00:13:24,220
<font color="white">You had me scared</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because you looked so serious.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

173
00:14:02,591 --> 00:14:05,427
<font color="white">CHOI JEONG-YO</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:14:22,861 --> 00:14:26,365
<font color="white">MOM</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:14:30,911 --> 00:14:32,204
<font color="white"><i>The call cannot be connected.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:14:32,288 --> 00:14:35,332
<font color="white"><i>You will be connected to voicemail</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>after the beep,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:14:35,416 --> 00:14:36,542
<font color="white"><i>and call charges will apply.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:14:53,225 --> 00:14:54,727
<font color="white">Where were you?</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:14:59,773 --> 00:15:00,774
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:15:02,359 --> 00:15:03,444
<font color="white">Did you tell him?</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:05,613
<font color="white">You told him?</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:20,377
<font color="white">Go inside.</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:15:33,974 --> 00:15:35,142
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:15:36,894 --> 00:15:38,854
<font color="white">I didn't get a chance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to tell you something.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

185
00:15:40,064 --> 00:15:41,190
<font color="white">Can I come in?</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:15:48,906 --> 00:15:50,282
<font color="white">This is a nice practice room.</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:15:52,117 --> 00:15:53,535
<font color="white">You get great sunlight.</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:15:54,161 --> 00:15:57,623
<font color="white">The music would just play itself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in a room like this.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

189
00:15:58,415 --> 00:15:59,667
<font color="white">What did you want to tell me?</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:16:00,417 --> 00:16:01,251
<font color="white">Right.</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:16:08,676 --> 00:16:09,551
<font color="white">What's this?</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:16:09,635 --> 00:16:11,553
<font color="white">It's the piano concerto I composed.</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:16:12,513 --> 00:16:14,098
<font color="white">It took me five years to finish.</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:16:14,723 --> 00:16:17,101
<font color="white">I felt it was time</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to share this with the world,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

195
00:16:17,184 --> 00:16:19,603
<font color="white">so I've been looking for</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a soloist to play it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

196
00:16:20,562 --> 00:16:21,480
<font color="white">Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:22,982 --> 00:16:24,483
<font color="white">Please be the first to play this.</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:26,986 --> 00:16:28,112
<font color="white">I can't.</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:29,071 --> 00:16:29,947
<font color="white">Why not?</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,699
<font color="white">I already told you. I…</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:34,451 --> 00:16:36,620
<font color="white">I have no right to play that.</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:38,789
<font color="white">And I already told you.</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:16:39,623 --> 00:16:42,918
<font color="white">I merely provided the interpretation.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You won first place on your own merits.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

204
00:16:44,294 --> 00:16:46,922
<font color="white">At least check it out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before you shut me down.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

205
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,341
<font color="white">You haven't even looked at it.</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:44,813 --> 00:17:45,814
<font color="white">Just as I thought.</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:47,608
<font color="white">I can't do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:47,691 --> 00:17:50,027
<font color="white">Why not? You don't like the piece?</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:50,611 --> 00:17:52,738
<font color="white">No, the piece is beautiful.</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:17:53,614 --> 00:17:56,366
<font color="white">I can tell how much effort</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you put into it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

211
00:17:57,493 --> 00:17:59,661
<font color="white">Everyone will be stunned</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when it comes out.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

212
00:17:59,745 --> 00:18:01,121
<font color="white">Then why won't you do it?</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:18:02,748 --> 00:18:03,665
<font color="white">Just…</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:18:05,542 --> 00:18:08,545
<font color="white">Just find someone else.</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:18:09,671 --> 00:18:11,381
<font color="white">I just told you.</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:18:14,843 --> 00:18:17,721
<font color="white">I've looked everywhere,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and you're the one I want.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

217
00:18:18,847 --> 00:18:21,183
<font color="white">I don't need just any pianist.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:18:21,266 --> 00:18:25,145
<font color="white">I need someone as dedicated as I am</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who will pour their soul into it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

219
00:18:26,063 --> 00:18:28,524
<font color="white">Our recent performance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">made me even more certain.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

220
00:18:28,607 --> 00:18:31,068
<font color="white">The only person</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who would give it their all</font><font color="white"></font></font>

221
00:18:31,819 --> 00:18:33,278
<font color="white">is you, Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:18:35,697 --> 00:18:37,407
<font color="white">What if we look at it this way?</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:18:39,952 --> 00:18:42,079
<font color="white">If you've been</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">torturing yourself with guilt,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

224
00:18:43,497 --> 00:18:46,500
<font color="white">use this as an opportunity</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to make it up to me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

225
00:18:47,751 --> 00:18:49,002
<font color="white">Still not interested?</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:18:51,839 --> 00:18:54,216
<font color="white">If you won't do it,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I won't release the piece.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

227
00:18:55,676 --> 00:18:56,760
<font color="white">So choose your answer wisely.</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:18:58,345 --> 00:19:00,222
<font color="white">I'm going to wait until you say yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:19:08,438 --> 00:19:09,481
<font color="white">I'll be off then.</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:19:11,233 --> 00:19:12,818
<font color="white">I'll be looking forward to good news.</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:19:31,753 --> 00:19:33,213
<font color="white">What did he mean by that?</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:19:33,297 --> 00:19:34,673
<font color="white">Do what together?</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:19:34,756 --> 00:19:36,049
<font color="white">Were you eavesdropping?</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:19:38,886 --> 00:19:40,470
<font color="white">What did he mean by you feeling guilty?</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:19:40,554 --> 00:19:42,264
<font color="white">How much did you tell him?</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:19:42,806 --> 00:19:45,058
<font color="white">I didn't tell him about you, so just stop.</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:19:45,601 --> 00:19:47,519
<font color="white">Stay out of my business.</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:19:52,941 --> 00:19:54,109
<font color="white"><i>You asked me before</i></font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:19:54,943 --> 00:19:57,070
<font color="white">why I'm conducting instead of playing.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:19:57,654 --> 00:19:58,697
<font color="white">Nine years ago,</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:01,575
<font color="white">I got shot in my right shoulder.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:20:02,534 --> 00:20:04,203
<font color="white"><i>It caused nerve damage in my fingers.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:20:04,286 --> 00:20:06,955
<font color="white"><i>I can get through daily life,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>but I can't play anymore.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:20:08,707 --> 00:20:11,168
<font color="white"><i>Take away music from a musician,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and he's left with hell.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:20:12,544 --> 00:20:13,629
<font color="white">But a slump…</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:17,090
<font color="white">is something you can work your way out of.</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:20:18,342 --> 00:20:19,384
<font color="white"><i>That's not the case for me.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:20:20,636 --> 00:20:22,512
<font color="white"><i>I'm actually envious of you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:20:28,936 --> 00:20:30,896
<font color="white"><i>If you've been</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>torturing yourself with guilt,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:20:32,439 --> 00:20:35,275
<font color="white"><i>use this as an opportunity</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to make it up to me.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:50,040
<font color="white">CHOI JEONG-YO:</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">HOW LONG WILL YOU KEEP ME WAITING?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

252
00:20:50,123 --> 00:20:52,042
<font color="white">IF YOU FEEL BAD ABOUT THE PAST,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">THEN JUST DO IT.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

253
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:28,912
<font color="white">I'll do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:21:29,871 --> 00:21:32,207
<font color="white">If that's what you want,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'll give it my best.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

255
00:21:34,209 --> 00:21:35,794
<font color="white">But if you're not satisfied…</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:21:37,546 --> 00:21:39,339
<font color="white">you can replace me anytime.</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:21:39,423 --> 00:21:41,258
<font color="white">I genuinely want to make an effort…</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:21:44,553 --> 00:21:45,846
<font color="white">for your sake.</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:21:50,976 --> 00:21:52,978
<font color="white">You composed this?</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:21:53,478 --> 00:21:54,563
<font color="white">Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:21:56,732 --> 00:21:58,734
<font color="white">It's not bad for your first piece.</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:22:01,111 --> 00:22:02,279
<font color="white">The only thing is…</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:22:02,988 --> 00:22:06,116
<font color="white">Were you thinking of someone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when you composed this?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

264
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,201
<font color="white">How strange.</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:22:09,119 --> 00:22:12,539
<font color="white">Why do I hear the composer's narrative</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before the music itself?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

266
00:22:15,959 --> 00:22:16,877
<font color="white">I'm not sure.</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:22:18,211 --> 00:22:20,839
<font color="white">I just tried to put</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my true feelings into it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

268
00:22:24,718 --> 00:22:25,886
<font color="white">So,</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:22:25,969 --> 00:22:28,889
<font color="white">why did you show this to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:22:31,850 --> 00:22:32,809
<font color="white">I was hoping…</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:22:35,437 --> 00:22:38,607
<font color="white">to premiere this piece at the orchestra's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">80th anniversary festival.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

272
00:22:40,192 --> 00:22:42,027
<font color="white">What do you think of it, Mr. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:22:43,070 --> 00:22:43,904
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:46,448
<font color="white">Go ahead and do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:22:49,034 --> 00:22:49,993
<font color="white">However,</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:22:50,744 --> 00:22:54,748
<font color="white">I hope the performance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">can move beyond personal sentiment</font><font color="white"></font></font>

277
00:22:56,249 --> 00:22:58,502
<font color="white">and become a piece</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that speaks to everyone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

278
00:22:59,169 --> 00:23:00,587
<font color="white">Can you do that?</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:02,798
<font color="white">Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:23:03,882 --> 00:23:06,426
<font color="white">Is there a soloist you have in mind?</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:23:07,636 --> 00:23:09,596
<font color="white">Yes, I do.</font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:23:12,432 --> 00:23:13,767
<font color="white">Pianist Kang Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:23:17,979 --> 00:23:19,106
<font color="white">Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:23:21,525 --> 00:23:22,400
<font color="white">Really?</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:23:23,110 --> 00:23:27,906
<font color="white">How about a more explosive</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and powerful pianist?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

286
00:23:28,698 --> 00:23:31,827
<font color="white">I believe he has that kind of potential.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:23:33,036 --> 00:23:34,412
<font color="white">And I can draw it out of him.</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:23:44,297 --> 00:23:46,091
<font color="white">This is a beautiful piece.</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:23:53,223 --> 00:23:56,309
<font color="white">Pi-o is truly so lucky.</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:24:13,743 --> 00:24:15,620
<font color="white">May I ask you something?</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:24:16,413 --> 00:24:17,497
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:24:17,581 --> 00:24:22,294
<font color="white">You seem unusually harsh on Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:24:24,129 --> 00:24:27,174
<font color="white">He's had a lot of success</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and earned a reputation.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

294
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:29,384
<font color="white">Isn't it time to acknowledge him?</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:24:30,218 --> 00:24:31,553
<font color="white">So why do you still--</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:24:31,636 --> 00:24:33,430
<font color="white">He takes after me.</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,267
<font color="white">He'll push himself to the limit…</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:24:40,103 --> 00:24:42,856
<font color="white">then choose to self-destruct</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if it doesn't work out.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

299
00:24:44,316 --> 00:24:45,442
<font color="white">You see,</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:24:45,525 --> 00:24:50,238
<font color="white">art is a nasty beast that won't rest</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">until it drains you dry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

301
00:24:55,911 --> 00:24:58,371
<font color="white">It does that even to talented musicians.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:25:00,916 --> 00:25:01,917
<font color="white">Just imagine…</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:25:04,544 --> 00:25:06,546
<font color="white">what it would do to those who aren't.</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:25:19,893 --> 00:25:21,811
<font color="white">Goodness, you're amazing.</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:25:23,897 --> 00:25:24,856
<font color="white">Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:25:25,607 --> 00:25:28,485
<font color="white">In addition to premiering this piece,</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:25:28,568 --> 00:25:31,488
<font color="white">how about releasing an album</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before the 80th anniversary festival?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

308
00:25:31,571 --> 00:25:33,490
<font color="white">-An album?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

309
00:25:33,573 --> 00:25:36,201
<font color="white">If you release an album,</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:25:36,284 --> 00:25:39,329
<font color="white">it'll establish the two of you as a brand,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">like I suggested before.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

311
00:25:39,955 --> 00:25:43,500
<font color="white">It'll give the 80th anniversary festival</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a huge promotional boost as well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

312
00:25:44,125 --> 00:25:45,919
<font color="white">That's a great idea.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:25:46,878 --> 00:25:48,505
<font color="white">What do you think, Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:25:49,547 --> 00:25:52,842
<font color="white">Well, as long as the pianist agrees…</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:25:58,890 --> 00:25:59,891
<font color="white"><i>No, Pi-o.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:26:01,893 --> 00:26:03,186
<font color="white">Why would you do this?</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:26:03,270 --> 00:26:05,063
<font color="white">You should be steering clear of him.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:26:05,146 --> 00:26:07,065
<font color="white">Why do you keep</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">involving yourself with him?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

319
00:26:07,148 --> 00:26:08,900
<font color="white">Why are you playing with fire?</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:26:08,984 --> 00:26:11,152
<font color="white">You're only worried about getting caught.</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:26:11,236 --> 00:26:12,988
<font color="white">You feel no guilt toward Jeong-yo, do you?</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:26:14,739 --> 00:26:17,951
<font color="white">The only way I can make it up to him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is to perform well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

323
00:26:19,577 --> 00:26:21,413
<font color="white">What if he's up to something?</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:26:21,997 --> 00:26:24,499
<font color="white">I'm terrified</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he's getting in your way on purpose.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

325
00:26:27,085 --> 00:26:28,628
<font color="white">Even if that's true, it can't be helped.</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:26:30,088 --> 00:26:32,674
<font color="white">If I can be the fuel for his fire,</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:26:33,550 --> 00:26:34,759
<font color="white">I'll do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

328
