<font color="white">Father.</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:40:02,191 --> 00:40:05,486
<font color="white">There's no retirement age for a conductor,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so why are you stepping down?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

493
00:40:05,569 --> 00:40:07,279
<font color="white">Who told you that?</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:40:08,489 --> 00:40:10,366
<font color="white">It was supposed to be a secret.</font><font color="white"></font>

495
00:40:10,449 --> 00:40:11,784
<font color="white">Why is Choi Jeong-yo your successor?</font><font color="white"></font>

496
00:40:11,867 --> 00:40:15,413
<font color="white">There are so many conductors</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">hoping to succeed you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

497
00:40:15,913 --> 00:40:18,332
<font color="white">Why would you pass it on</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to someone so inexperienced?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

498
00:40:18,416 --> 00:40:19,875
<font color="white">What's the matter with you?</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:40:21,335 --> 00:40:23,462
<font color="white">Why do you hate Choi Jeong-yo so much?</font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:40:23,546 --> 00:40:25,589
<font color="white">Does he have something on you?</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:40:27,258 --> 00:40:28,759
<font color="white">Be kind.</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:40:30,261 --> 00:40:32,096
<font color="white">Or else you'll make more enemies,</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:40:32,179 --> 00:40:34,849
<font color="white">and your child will end up with bad karma.</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:40:34,932 --> 00:40:37,226
<font color="white"><i>Do you still not know how the world works?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:40:48,821 --> 00:40:49,947
<font color="white">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:40:50,865 --> 00:40:51,699
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:40:52,616 --> 00:40:54,827
<font color="white">Mr. Kang, did you get some practice in?</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:40:55,995 --> 00:40:57,037
<font color="white">Let's hear you play.</font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:09,568
<font color="white">So?</font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:42:12,446 --> 00:42:13,489
<font color="white">You didn't like it?</font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:42:18,077 --> 00:42:20,371
<font color="white">Maybe my expectations were too high.</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:42:20,871 --> 00:42:23,040
<font color="white">Or maybe you needed more time</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to study the score.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

513
00:42:23,123 --> 00:42:26,377
<font color="white">Your interpretation</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sounded too superficial.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

514
00:42:26,961 --> 00:42:30,548
<font color="white">I can't even give you feedback</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at this point.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

515
00:42:31,257 --> 00:42:34,093
<font color="white">Why don't you study it some more</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and try again next week?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

516
00:42:34,843 --> 00:42:35,678
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:42:40,724 --> 00:42:43,394
<font color="white">What exactly didn't you like?</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:42:43,477 --> 00:42:46,689
<font color="white">I did my best to interpret it</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and practiced just as hard.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

519
00:42:48,190 --> 00:42:51,652
<font color="white">But if I'm going in the wrong direction,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you should tell me why.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

520
00:42:52,653 --> 00:42:53,654
<font color="white">Oh…</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:42:55,072 --> 00:42:57,074
<font color="white">So this is what you call trying hard?</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:42:58,242 --> 00:43:01,161
<font color="white">Shall we go over everything</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the start then?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

523
00:43:03,372 --> 00:43:05,666
<font color="white">Mr. Kang, what is the theme of this piece?</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:43:08,752 --> 00:43:11,338
<font color="white">The consequences</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">brought upon the arrogant.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

525
00:43:13,215 --> 00:43:15,009
<font color="white">That's a convincing interpretation.</font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:43:15,718 --> 00:43:19,888
<font color="white">Then why did you play</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every phrase so beautifully?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

527
00:43:20,598 --> 00:43:22,850
<font color="white">With all your experience,</font><font color="white"></font>

528
00:43:22,933 --> 00:43:26,729
<font color="white">why are you still hiding</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">behind that armor?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

529
00:43:29,648 --> 00:43:30,482
<font color="white">I'll see you next week.</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:43:33,235 --> 00:43:34,320
<font color="white">Good work today.</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:43:34,403 --> 00:43:35,446
<font color="white">Sorry about this.</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:43:40,784 --> 00:43:44,580
<font color="white">So are you going to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">take the structure completely apart?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

533
00:43:46,332 --> 00:43:47,958
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-That's a great idea.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

534
00:43:49,251 --> 00:43:51,253
<font color="white">A strong foundation</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">leads to better performance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

535
00:43:57,885 --> 00:43:58,719
<font color="white">Come in.</font><font color="white"></font>

536
00:44:00,929 --> 00:44:01,847
<font color="white">It's a harpsichord.</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:44:18,906 --> 00:44:20,783
<font color="white">Can I practice on it for a few days?</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:44:20,866 --> 00:44:22,201
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:44:22,284 --> 00:44:23,702
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:44:25,788 --> 00:44:26,830
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:44:30,250 --> 00:44:31,251
<font color="white">Never mind.</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:44:31,335 --> 00:44:33,087
<font color="white">Just let me know when you leave.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:44:35,464 --> 00:44:36,507
<font color="white">I will.</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:44:57,528 --> 00:44:59,738
<font color="white">Mr. Kang, what is the theme of this piece?</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:45:00,239 --> 00:45:02,908
<font color="white">The consequences</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">brought upon the arrogant.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

546
00:45:02,991 --> 00:45:07,162
<font color="white">Then why did you play</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every phrase so beautifully?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

547
00:45:13,335 --> 00:45:15,754
<font color="white"><i>With all your experience,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:45:15,838 --> 00:45:19,633
<font color="white"><i>why are you still hiding</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>behind that armor?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:46:19,401 --> 00:46:20,402
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:46:21,987 --> 00:46:23,906
<font color="white">Does it still sound superficial?</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:46:24,781 --> 00:46:25,616
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:46:26,283 --> 00:46:27,284
<font color="white">I love it.</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:46:27,367 --> 00:46:30,746
<font color="white">It's more than that. It's really moving.</font><font color="white"></font>

554
00:46:31,872 --> 00:46:33,957
<font color="white">This is why I like you.</font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:46:34,041 --> 00:46:36,251
<font color="white">I really think you're a genius.</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:46:37,628 --> 00:46:39,546
<font color="white">No need to flatter me so much.</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:46:39,630 --> 00:46:40,964
<font color="white">Come on, I'm serious.</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:46:42,174 --> 00:46:45,135
<font color="white">I read the score before hearing you play,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and there's no disconnect.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

559
00:46:45,219 --> 00:46:46,136
<font color="white">Really?</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:47:34,142 --> 00:47:35,269
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:47:36,645 --> 00:47:38,438
<font color="white">Let's hear the cadenza again.</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:47:55,163 --> 00:47:56,081
<font color="white">Too slow.</font><font color="white"></font>

563
00:48:00,043 --> 00:48:01,211
<font color="white">Too fast.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:48:03,714 --> 00:48:04,548
<font color="white">It's slow.</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:48:09,636 --> 00:48:11,263
<font color="white">No, it's too fast!</font><font color="white"></font>

566
00:48:13,599 --> 00:48:15,309
<font color="white">What do you think you're doing?</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:48:15,392 --> 00:48:17,019
<font color="white">How unprepared are you</font><font color="white"></font>

568
00:48:17,102 --> 00:48:19,104
<font color="white">if you can't even</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">stay with the beat in the score?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

569
00:48:19,187 --> 00:48:21,565
<font color="white">This is not the tempo I wanted.</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:48:23,483 --> 00:48:24,610
<font color="white">Try again and come back.</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:48:36,038 --> 00:48:36,913
<font color="white">Hey, Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

572
00:48:40,709 --> 00:48:42,294
<font color="white">Explain it so that it makes sense.</font><font color="white"></font>

573
00:48:44,546 --> 00:48:46,381
<font color="white">Here. This is 160.</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:48:46,965 --> 00:48:48,634
<font color="white">This is the tempo you wrote down.</font><font color="white"></font>

575
00:48:48,717 --> 00:48:51,053
<font color="white">I practiced note by note to it.</font><font color="white"></font>

576
00:48:51,136 --> 00:48:52,179
<font color="white">But you say I got it wrong?</font><font color="white"></font>

577
00:48:52,679 --> 00:48:54,598
<font color="white">Which part did I play wrong?</font><font color="white"></font>

578
00:48:54,681 --> 00:48:56,975
<font color="white">What is the tempo inside your head?</font><font color="white"></font>

579
00:48:57,059 --> 00:48:57,893
<font color="white">Unbelievable.</font><font color="white"></font>

580
00:48:59,811 --> 00:49:03,398
<font color="white">Why haven't you changed at all, Mr. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

581
00:49:04,149 --> 00:49:05,317
<font color="white">Music is</font><font color="white"></font>

582
00:49:06,902 --> 00:49:11,615
<font color="white">not a ready-made meal</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you just heat up in the microwave.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

583
00:49:11,698 --> 00:49:12,824
<font color="white">I'm begging you.</font><font color="white"></font>

584
00:49:12,908 --> 00:49:15,035
<font color="white">Please feel the rhythm with your soul.</font><font color="white"></font>

585
00:49:16,703 --> 00:49:20,332
<font color="white">How do you expect to fight and win</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">against a hundred orchestra members?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

586
00:49:21,500 --> 00:49:22,542
<font color="white">Jeez.</font><font color="white"></font>

587
00:49:32,552 --> 00:49:33,804
<font color="white">I don't get it.</font><font color="white"></font>

588
00:49:35,055 --> 00:49:38,350
<font color="white">It sounded amazing to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

589
00:49:39,351 --> 00:49:41,395
<font color="white">What was Jeong-yo not happy about?</font><font color="white"></font>

590
00:49:42,646 --> 00:49:45,232
<font color="white">Do you want me to talk to him?</font><font color="white"></font>

591
00:49:46,274 --> 00:49:47,192
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

592
00:49:48,151 --> 00:49:50,737
<font color="white">I must've missed the composer's intent.</font><font color="white"></font>

593
00:49:50,821 --> 00:49:52,322
<font color="white">I'll give it some more thought.</font><font color="white"></font>

594
00:50:06,044 --> 00:50:07,087
<font color="white">Hey, what is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

595
00:50:07,170 --> 00:50:08,422
<font color="white">There's a problem.</font><font color="white"></font>

596
00:50:08,922 --> 00:50:11,758
<font color="white">Your dad disappeared,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and they haven't found him yet.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

597
00:50:11,842 --> 00:50:12,718
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

598
00:50:13,927 --> 00:50:15,095
<font color="white">When did he leave?</font><font color="white"></font>

599
00:50:15,178 --> 00:50:16,263
<font color="white">I don't know.</font><font color="white"></font>

600
00:50:16,346 --> 00:50:18,932
<font color="white">He went for a walk after lunch</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and vanished.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

601
00:50:19,015 --> 00:50:20,142
<font color="white">They only just found out?</font><font color="white"></font>

602
00:50:21,059 --> 00:50:22,477
<font color="white">Just wait. I'll be right there.</font><font color="white"></font>

603
00:50:51,423 --> 00:50:53,049
<font color="white">Did they check all the local bars?</font><font color="white"></font>

604
00:50:53,133 --> 00:50:55,802
<font color="white">Yeah, they searched everywhere,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but he's nowhere to be found.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

605
00:50:56,762 --> 00:50:58,764
<font color="white">They're asking whether</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">they should report him missing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

606
00:50:58,847 --> 00:51:00,098
<font color="white"><i>Should we let them?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

607
00:51:00,182 --> 00:51:01,475
<font color="white">Just wait a bit.</font><font color="white"></font>

608
00:51:02,559 --> 00:51:04,019
<font color="white">Let me go check out the situation.</font><font color="white"></font>

609
00:51:32,798 --> 00:51:36,051
<font color="white">ALCOHOL REHAB CENTER</font><font color="white"></font>

610
00:52:00,116 --> 00:52:01,618
<font color="white">What brings you here, Ms. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

611
00:52:03,995 --> 00:52:05,914
<font color="white">Oh, Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

612
00:52:06,957 --> 00:52:08,458
<font color="white">Why are you here?</font><font color="white"></font>

613
00:52:09,084 --> 00:52:13,296
<font color="white">The director here asked me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if I could perform for the patients.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

614
00:52:14,005 --> 00:52:16,049
<font color="white">But why are you here, Ms. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

615
00:52:16,132 --> 00:52:17,050
<font color="white">Oh, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

616
00:52:18,093 --> 00:52:20,220
<font color="white">I know someone who's a patient here,</font><font color="white"></font>

617
00:52:20,303 --> 00:52:21,721
<font color="white">so I came to visit them.</font><font color="white"></font>

618
00:52:21,805 --> 00:52:23,640
<font color="white">At an alcohol rehab center?</font><font color="white"></font>

619
00:52:25,225 --> 00:52:26,059
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

620
00:52:26,810 --> 00:52:29,980
<font color="white">It's amazing that you volunteer</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">despite your busy schedule.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

621
00:52:32,023 --> 00:52:33,024
<font color="white">It's nothing.</font><font color="white"></font>

622
00:52:34,025 --> 00:52:37,445
<font color="white">I'll need to hear the details</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before I decide whether I can do it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

623
00:52:37,529 --> 00:52:38,488
<font color="white">Nothing's confirmed yet.</font><font color="white"></font>

624
00:52:39,072 --> 00:52:40,073
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

625
00:52:40,156 --> 00:52:41,366
<font color="white">Still, it's amazing.</font><font color="white"></font>

626
00:52:42,200 --> 00:52:44,744
<font color="white">I should get going. See you later.</font><font color="white"></font>

627
00:52:45,328 --> 00:52:46,371
<font color="white">Goodbye.</font><font color="white"></font>

628
00:52:58,300 --> 00:53:00,260
<font color="white">What's going on? Is she onto us?</font><font color="white"></font>

629
00:53:03,013 --> 00:53:04,806
<font color="white">Did you tell the staff to keep quiet?</font><font color="white"></font>

630
00:53:04,890 --> 00:53:07,767
<font color="white">They won't say a word. Don't worry.</font><font color="white"></font>

631
00:53:09,561 --> 00:53:12,147
<font color="white">But seriously, where did your dad go?</font><font color="white"></font>

632
00:53:14,232 --> 00:53:15,442
<font color="white">MUSICAL INSTRUMENT ARCADE</font><font color="white"></font>

633
00:53:15,525 --> 00:53:17,485
<font color="white">Hey, I don't think he's here.</font><font color="white"></font>

634
00:53:18,528 --> 00:53:20,739
<font color="white">Let's call the cops</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and report him missing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

635
00:53:22,324 --> 00:53:23,783
<font color="white">Where the hell is he?</font><font color="white"></font>

636
00:53:25,327 --> 00:53:26,202
<font color="white">Hold on.</font><font color="white"></font>

637
00:53:27,829 --> 00:53:28,663
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

638
00:53:30,040 --> 00:53:33,126
<font color="white">KIM'S BOILED PORK</font><font color="white"></font>

639
00:53:35,253 --> 00:53:36,838
<font color="white">Is there a reason we're here?</font><font color="white"></font>

640
00:53:38,423 --> 00:53:39,382
<font color="white">What the heck?</font><font color="white"></font>

641
00:53:41,343 --> 00:53:42,677
<font color="white">How did you know he'd be here?</font><font color="white"></font>

642
00:53:43,720 --> 00:53:45,305
<font color="white">Look at him, all carefree.</font><font color="white"></font>

643
00:53:54,314 --> 00:53:56,691
<font color="white">-Mr. Choi, do you recognize me?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Huh?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

644
00:53:56,775 --> 00:53:58,735
<font color="white">-What do you want?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Let's get you back to the hospital.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

645
00:53:58,818 --> 00:54:01,237
<font color="white">No, I'm not going back to the hospital.</font><font color="white"></font>

646
00:54:01,321 --> 00:54:02,906
<font color="white">You need to go. You're a patient!</font><font color="white"></font>

647
00:54:02,989 --> 00:54:04,908
<font color="white">-No, I don't want to.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Come on, let's go!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

648
00:54:04,991 --> 00:54:06,576
<font color="white">I'm not going!</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:54:08,620 --> 00:54:11,748
<font color="white">-No, I don't want to go back.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Hey, don't run off!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

650
00:54:11,831 --> 00:54:14,334
<font color="white">-I said I'm not going back there.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It's this way, man.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

651
00:54:15,043 --> 00:54:17,587
<font color="white">Who's been paying my hospital bills?</font><font color="white"></font>

652
00:54:18,421 --> 00:54:20,256
<font color="white">Stop messing around</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and stay put, will you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

653
00:54:20,340 --> 00:54:22,217
<font color="white">-I said I'm not going back!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-In you go.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

654
00:54:26,805 --> 00:54:27,764
<font color="white">Go home.</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:54:59,921 --> 00:55:01,047
<font color="white"><i>Music is</i></font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:55:02,632 --> 00:55:07,387
<font color="white">not a ready-made meal</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you just heat up in the microwave.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

657
00:55:07,470 --> 00:55:08,555
<font color="white">I'm begging you.</font><font color="white"></font>

658
00:55:08,638 --> 00:55:10,682
<font color="white">Please feel the rhythm with your soul.</font><font color="white"></font>

659
00:56:08,698 --> 00:56:09,657
<font color="white">What are you doing here?</font><font color="white"></font>

660
00:56:10,867 --> 00:56:11,701
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

661
00:56:14,788 --> 00:56:18,166
<font color="white">What if Choi Jeong-yo</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">doesn't have amnesia?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

662
00:56:18,249 --> 00:56:19,417
<font color="white">Just stop already.</font><font color="white"></font>

663
00:56:20,668 --> 00:56:22,629
<font color="white">Do you still want to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">shift the blame to him?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

664
00:56:36,309 --> 00:56:37,811
<font color="white">That's not it, Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

665
00:56:37,894 --> 00:56:39,687
<font color="white">Something's strange about him.</font><font color="white"></font>

666
00:56:40,730 --> 00:56:42,440
<font color="white">He has amnesia but returned to Korea.</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:56:42,524 --> 00:56:45,068
<font color="white">Out of all the orchestras,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he chose the Hankook Symphony.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

668
00:56:45,151 --> 00:56:46,236
<font color="white">But most of all,</font><font color="white"></font>

669
00:56:46,945 --> 00:56:48,696
<font color="white">he keeps getting involved with you.</font><font color="white"></font>

670
00:56:50,073 --> 00:56:51,574
<font color="white">Isn't that strange?</font><font color="white"></font>

671
00:56:53,451 --> 00:56:55,370
<font color="white">I just couldn't figure him out,</font><font color="white"></font>

672
00:56:55,453 --> 00:56:57,455
<font color="white">so I followed him last night.</font><font color="white"></font>

673
00:56:57,539 --> 00:57:01,251
<font color="white">And I saw him go inside</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">an alcohol rehab center.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

674
00:57:04,295 --> 00:57:05,588
<font color="white">You followed him?</font><font color="white"></font>

675
00:57:08,216 --> 00:57:09,467
<font color="white">Just listen for a second.</font><font color="white"></font>

676
00:57:10,426 --> 00:57:12,262
<font color="white">He somehow found out I was following him</font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:57:12,345 --> 00:57:13,972
<font color="white">and suddenly showed up acting friendly.</font><font color="white"></font>

678
00:57:15,223 --> 00:57:17,517
<font color="white">He doesn't know a single person in Korea,</font><font color="white"></font>

679
00:57:17,600 --> 00:57:20,478
<font color="white">yet he went to the outskirts of Seoul</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to do volunteer work.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

680
00:57:20,562 --> 00:57:22,397
<font color="white">It makes no sense when he's so busy.</font><font color="white"></font>

681
00:57:23,773 --> 00:57:25,275
<font color="white">It was weird how he blocked me.</font><font color="white"></font>

682
00:57:26,025 --> 00:57:27,402
<font color="white">He's hiding something.</font><font color="white"></font>

683
00:57:27,485 --> 00:57:31,030
<font color="white">He had a strange look in his eyes</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when I saw him at the Seodam Art Center.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

684
00:57:31,948 --> 00:57:34,534
<font color="white"><i>He left in the middle of the event,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>went into a practice room,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

685
00:57:34,617 --> 00:57:36,494
<font color="white"><i>and stared out the window</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>through the curtains.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

686
00:57:36,578 --> 00:57:37,412
<font color="white">Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

687
00:57:38,288 --> 00:57:40,206
<font color="white"><i>He seemed very flustered when I walked in.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

688
00:57:40,290 --> 00:57:41,291
<font color="white">Could it be</font><font color="white"></font>

689
00:57:42,250 --> 00:57:43,793
<font color="white">that his memory is back?</font><font color="white"></font>

690
00:57:44,836 --> 00:57:47,172
<font color="white">His mom passed away</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the Seodam Art Center.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

691
00:57:48,590 --> 00:57:50,383
<font color="white">There's no way he could forget that.</font><font color="white"></font>

692
00:57:52,927 --> 00:57:53,845
<font color="white">Mom.</font><font color="white"></font>

693
00:57:54,345 --> 00:57:56,055
<font color="white">Stop wasting your time imagining things.</font><font color="white"></font>

694
00:57:56,639 --> 00:57:57,849
<font color="white">And stop following Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

695
00:57:59,184 --> 00:58:00,393
<font color="white">If you do that again…</font><font color="white"></font>

696
00:58:02,562 --> 00:58:04,147
<font color="white">I won't let it slide.</font><font color="white"></font>

697
00:58:24,959 --> 00:58:28,213
<font color="white">Why haven't you changed at all, Mr. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

698
00:58:36,804 --> 00:58:40,391
<font color="white">How do you expect to fight and win</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">against a hundred orchestra members?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

699
00:58:40,475 --> 00:58:42,143
<font color="white"><i>So in a concerto,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

700
00:58:42,227 --> 00:58:45,563
<font color="white">a pianist has to fight and win</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">against a hundred orchestra members,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

701
00:58:46,189 --> 00:58:47,774
<font color="white"><i>while still working together at times.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

702
00:58:48,399 --> 00:58:50,360
<font color="white">Avoiding a slump</font><font color="white"></font>

703
00:58:50,443 --> 00:58:52,320
<font color="white">isn't going to solve anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

704
00:58:52,403 --> 00:58:55,365
<font color="white">You need to face it at some point.</font><font color="white"></font>

705
00:58:55,448 --> 00:58:57,909
<font color="white">Ignoring the problem won't solve anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

706
00:58:58,910 --> 00:59:01,329
<font color="white">You need to face it at some point.</font><font color="white"></font>

707
00:59:26,145 --> 00:59:27,772
<font color="white"><i>He's hiding something.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

708
00:59:27,855 --> 00:59:31,317
<font color="white">He had a strange look in his eyes</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when I saw him at the Seodam Art Center.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

709
00:59:40,702 --> 00:59:44,080
<font color="white"><i>What if Choi Jeong-yo</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>doesn't have amnesia?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

710
00:59:56,467 --> 00:59:58,469
<font color="white">Pi-o, let's make a promise.</font><font color="white"></font>

711
00:59:59,053 --> 01:00:00,847
<font color="white">Let's play some more four hands</font><font color="white"></font>

712
01:00:00,930 --> 01:00:02,974
<font color="white">even after the competition.</font><font color="white"></font>

713
01:00:03,057 --> 01:00:03,891
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

714
01:00:16,863 --> 01:00:19,741
<font color="white"><i>He left in the middle of the event,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>went into a practice room,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

715
01:00:19,824 --> 01:00:21,576
<font color="white"><i>and stared out the window</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>through the curtains.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

716
01:00:27,373 --> 01:00:29,000
<font color="white"><i>He seemed very flustered when I walked in.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

717
01:00:29,083 --> 01:00:29,917
<font color="white"><i>Could it be</i></font><font color="white"></font>

718
01:00:31,210 --> 01:00:32,754
<font color="white"><i>that his memory is back?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

719
01:00:42,930 --> 01:00:45,350
<font color="white"><i>Promise you won't sulk</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>if I win first place.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

720
01:00:45,433 --> 01:00:46,851
<font color="white"><i>Let's still have fun when we hang out.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

721
01:00:46,934 --> 01:00:48,936
<font color="white"><i>But I'm going to win first place.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

722
01:00:49,020 --> 01:00:49,854
<font color="white"><i>Don't get sulky yourself.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

723
01:00:55,360 --> 01:00:58,154
{\an8}<font color="white">SPECIAL THANKS TO KO CHANG-SEOK</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">FOR HIS GUEST APPEARANCE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

724
01:01:18,675 --> 01:01:20,802
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

725
01:01:20,885 --> 01:01:22,595
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I know you remember everything.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

726
01:01:22,679 --> 01:01:24,639
{\an8}<font color="white">Why did you tell such a lie?</font><font color="white"></font>

727
01:01:25,431 --> 01:01:28,518
{\an8}<font color="white">I don't understand what you're saying.</font><font color="white"></font>

728
01:01:28,601 --> 01:01:31,688
{\an8}<font color="white">We need to get rid of him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so he can't talk.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

729
01:01:31,771 --> 01:01:32,980
{\an8}<font color="white">Just call me Kim.</font><font color="white"></font>

730
01:01:33,564 --> 01:01:36,859
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I didn't struggle to come back alive</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>just to give you a free pass.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

731
01:01:36,943 --> 01:01:38,027
{\an8}<font color="white">And here!</font><font color="white"></font>

732
01:01:38,778 --> 01:01:41,948
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>At this rate, both of you will go down.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

733
01:01:42,031 --> 01:01:43,825
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Whether I ruin my fingers</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>or the performance,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

734
01:01:43,908 --> 01:01:45,284
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I'll take full responsibility.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

735
01:01:46,327 --> 01:01:47,787
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Break the mold, Pi-o.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

736
01:01:49,330 --> 01:01:54,335
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim</font><font color="white"></font>
